That means libswlib.a wasn't compiled with -fpic or -fPIC.  Any 
object file or static library that gets linked to a dynamic 
library needs to be compiled with -fpic or -fPIC on Alpha, 
otherwise you're likely to get the "gp-relative relocation" 
error.

